## How to use this content

- Use these section titles directly as headings (H1 for hero, H2/H3 for later sections).
- Treat each bullet or paragraph as starter copy you can refine; keep benefits and outcomes clear.
- Use card/box layouts for:
  - Services (development, marketing, IT).
  - Ad campaign types (Google ads, social, email).
  - Case studies and testimonials.
- Make sure each section has at least one visible CTA or link so visitors always have a clear “next step” (view services, read a case study, start a project).

